          "settings": {
            "tag": "Results",
            "icon": "trend",
            "question": "When will I actually notice something?",
            "answer": "<p>The first thing you notice is the fit: the 3D texture and the high waist smooth and support your shape the moment you put them on. Anything beyond that depends on your body, your size and how you wear them, so we don't promise a timeline. Here is a simple way to get to know your leggings:</p>",
